# cabin_sky_cloudy: a low overcast over the cabin (BUILD_PLAN S7, 5.8): the
# clear sky's flat glacier blue under the name (rows 0 to 28), then the
# deck, in flat fills: its lit tops a deep white mass (snow) with five
# rounded billows along its top, its body glacier blue over its slate
# underside, which runs down to the valley. At dusk and dawn its lit tops
# go alpenglow pink over a slate body. The whole sky layer, at the plate's
# origin; its frame runs one pixel outside.
